# FocusGuard 🧠

**AI-Powered Distraction Blocker**

FocusGuard is an intelligent desktop application that uses computer vision and behavioral analysis to detect when you're getting distracted and helps you stay focused.

## ✨ Features

- **AI-Powered Detection**: Uses ML models to analyze both screen content and user behavior
- **Context-Aware**: Distinguishes between productive and distracting content
- **Smart Interventions**: Gradual interventions based on distraction level
- **Privacy-Focused**: All processing happens locally on your machine
- **Real-time Analytics**: Monitor your focus patterns and productivity

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.8 or higher
- Tesseract OCR (for text extraction)
- Screen recording permission (macOS)

### Installation

1. Clone the repository:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/focusguard.git
cd focusguard